# HuntTrackPipe - Project Goal

Local, single-user job-application pipeline. Pasted posting -> Jev (TypeSafe) typed questions -> dynamic JSON schema -> Claude Haiku 5.5 extraction -> per-application folder + one row in `JobHunting/Applications/job_application_tracker.xlsx`; plus file conversion/combining, application Q&A, re-extract diff, duplicate detection, Settings page. Full spec: `docs/DESIGN.md` (keep it in sync when decisions change).

## Key decisions (agreed with user, do not change without asking)
- **Excel is the only source of truth for tracker columns.** No database. Non-tracker state lives in `<application folder>/session.json`.
- **Decoupled from Resumate** (`../resumate`): share files, never import its code. Same stack on purpose (FastAPI + Vue 3).
- **Jev = pre-LLM filter.** Nouls gate which fields go into the LLM schema (include at >= 0.35). Work_Mode / Employment_Type choices are written directly at confidence >= 0.7, otherwise added to the schema as enums. Upload mode + required-doc nouls are hints for the Files tab.
- **Manual columns, never sent to Jev or the LLM:** Applied_Date, Posting_URL, Application_Status, Outcome, Applied_Through, Confirmation_#. Days_Since_Applied is a formula; Folder is written by the engine.
- **Folder name** `{Requisition_ID}_{Organization}_{Position_Title}_{Date_Created}` (creation date, never renamed). `null` for missing parts; `_{unix_ts}` only when the first three are all null; `_2`, `_3` on collision.
- **File names:** inputs `{count}_<name>.<ext>`; separate finals `{Candidate_Name}_{DocType}_{X}.<ext>`; combined `{Candidate_Name}_{X}.pdf` (combined output is PDF only).
- **Q&A context** is one user-written `JobHunting/candidate_context.txt`, read fresh every call.
- **Ports:** API 8010, UI 5180 (Resumate uses 8000 / 5173; both must run side by side).
- **Start:** `npm run api` calls `resumate_env`'s `python.exe -m uvicorn` (see root `package.json`). Do not change it back to a bare `uvicorn` command; that fails unless the venv is already on PATH.
- **Upload mode:** a stated Jev choice is kept. `not_stated` or no usable answer becomes `separate_uploads` in `derive()` and again in `create_application()`.
- **Posting text on screen** is cleaned for display and Copy all only (`cleanPostingText`). The saved posting, duplicate hash, and re-extract input stay raw.
- **Duplicates are refused, not blocked:** `POST /sessions` returns 409 `DuplicateError` unless `allow_duplicate`; the UI confirms. **Re-extract never writes** - the user applies chosen columns via `PUT /row` + `force_columns`.
- **Logs never contain** posting text, candidate context or answers.

## Repo layout
```
backend/
  config.py        Settings from htp.config.json (+ HTP_CONFIG override) and .env
  naming.py        sanitize, folder/file names, {X} token
  pipeline.py      extract() + create_application(), shared by CLI and API
  run.py           CLI: python -m backend.run
  columns.py       tracker column registry + dropdown options + /api/meta payload
  duplicates.py    posting_hash(), find_duplicates(), DuplicateError (409)
  logs.py          setup_logging() -> console + Applications/.htp_logs/htp.log; tail()
  main.py          FastAPI app (:8010), lifespan starts logging, exception -> HTTP status mapping
  api/             models.py, deps.py, routers/ (extract, sessions [+reextract], files, qa, settings [+PUT, /logs])
  jev/             questions.py (question set + Excel mappings), client.py, derive.py
  llm/             schema_builder.py, prompts.py, client.py, postprocess.py
  excel/tracker.py openpyxl writer
  files/           convert.py (soffice, pdf2docx, PyMuPDF, img2pdf), combine.py (pypdf), manager.py (FileManager: manifest <-> disk)
  qa/answer.py     answer_questions() (one structured call, limit check + re-ask), answers.md rendering
  sessions/        models.py (session.json), store.py
frontend/          Vue 3 + Vite + Pinia + Tailwind v4 (:5180); views Dashboard, NewApplication, Session, Convert, Settings
tests/             pytest suite (offline, synthetic tracker, fake Jev/Claude); run `python -m pytest`
docs/DESIGN.md     design spec
htp.config.json    non-secret settings
JobHunting/        personal data (git-ignored: Applications/*, candidate_context.txt)
```

